Tawakal Dental Clinic
Location: Saudabad, Malir, Karachi

Services identified in your lead:
- Scaling
- Root Canal Treatment (RCT)
- Tooth Extraction
- Dental Crowns
Lead information: 5 staff ka figure aur 1 ki additional entry tumhari lead sheet mein nazar aati hai; exact staffing structure manually confirm hoga.

Project objective

Complete clinic operations, patient records, appointments, doctors, treatment plans, billing, expenses, stock, AI phone receptionist aur business analytics ko ek central software mein manage karna.

Clinic name, contact details aur Google presence ko abhi independently verified business facts nahi maan rahe. Tumhari supplied lead sheet ko working reference samjha gaya hai.

Meri vision: Doctor ko apne clinic ka har important kaam ek hi screen se manage karne ki facility mile. Receptionist ko patient aur appointment manage karne ke liye alag registers ki zaroorat na ho. AI receptionist incoming calls receive kare aur patients ki appointments manage kare. Owner ko poore clinic ka financial aur operational control mile.
