25.3 Pakistan mein phone integration ka important issue
Tumhare client ka clinic Karachi mein hai, isliye phone number ka setup pehle technically verify karna zaroori hai.

Vapi ke free phone numbers US area codes ke hote hain aur inbound-only hote hain. International calling ke liye external telephony provider ka number import karna padta hai. 
Vapi+1


Twilio Pakistan ke liye outbound voice pricing publish karta hai. Uski published rate page par Pakistan local calls aur mobile calls ki rates alag hain; telephony, AI aur additional service charges alag calculate honge. Lekin pricing table ko Pakistani local mobile number ki provisioning ya existing number porting ki guarantee nahi samajhna chahiye. 
Twilio+1


Meri recommendation:

Clinic ka existing business number pehle retain karein. Local carrier se verify karein ke:
- Call forwarding available hai?
- SIP trunk available hai?
- Existing number ka inbound traffic external AI agent ko route ho sakta hai?
- Number ka caller ID / outbound calling supported hai?
- International provider ke saath number import ya routing supported hai?
Yeh feasibility test AI calling development se pehle karna zaroori hai.
